      "id": "claim_6826455f619844ea9d43a3a07796cfaa",
      "statement": "Loader selection is owned by Extractor.get_document_loader (primary loader if it can_handle, then extension map, then capability scan, DocumentLoaderData for list/dict sources, DocumentLoaderLLMImage when allow_vision), while capability detection is owned by the DocumentLoader base using file extensions for paths and libmagic MIME sniffing for BytesIO streams.",
